      "name": "Choose **Upload picture** and pick a PNG, JPEG, WebP, GIF…",
      "text": "Choose **Upload picture** and pick a PNG, JPEG, WebP, GIF or AVIF image up to 20 MB. Your browser crops it to a square and re-encodes it, which removes camera and location metadata. Use **Change picture** to replace it or **Remove picture** to delete it.",
